{
  "analysis": "The review describes spending time grinding, which names repetitive gameplay activity, so T_Grinding applies. The ban, automated moderation, false censorship, and unclear punishment are not covered by any listed mechanic label. Chatting with friends does not describe recruitment, obligation, or resource exchange, so no social label applies. Losing years of progress and money is a realized loss caused by moderation, not investment making it difficult to quit, so P_EasyToGetHardToLose is rejected under its counterexample rule. No schedule, reward cadence, purchase prompt, gambling, or other codable mechanic is described.",
  "labels": [
    {
      "label": "T_Grinding",
      "span": "I mainly spent time grinding",
