  "search_result": null
}

{
  "analysis": "The review describes a reward tied to inviting friends, which satisfies Forced Fellowship. “Played max bet” with dice and “NO LUCK” describes wagering an in-game resource in a chance-based mechanic, so Gambling applies. Repeated duplicate stickers and unfavorable random outcomes describe Reward Mania. No Pay to Progress, Complete the Collection, or Waste Aversion mechanic is stated. The internet connection error is a technical fault, so it is suppressed under R11.",
